{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "158", "x": 0.8945440628158089, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.039199185787826864, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 1", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.06881167324518032, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): I'm losing touch with my friends and colleagues.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17688928348818467, "w": 0.7728033951753602, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): We really miss you in the office. We were all so sorry you had", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.20240146832783631, "w": 0.8263467447250655, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "to leave, but you must be relieved to have more time to look after your mother.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22791365316748796, "w": 0.8258161780891256, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "How is she?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25342576256435456, "w": 0.1310644407268896, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Well, she's very cheerful, but she needs a lot of help.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.27897506525423693, "w": 0.8189970383616595, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Have you tried to get any support from the local council?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.30448717465110353, "w": 0.7917511344129826, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): No, I didn't know I could.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32985102011470624, "w": 0.5320756751037526, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yes, they offer different kinds of practical support. They", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.35536320495435786, "w": 0.8260763864218822, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "realize that carers sometimes need time for all the other responsibilities they", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38087538979400953, "w": 0.825909475797088, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "have. apart from the person they're caring for and also that they sometimes need", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.826185780547592, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a break.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43189968403052775, "w": 0.0911531294255537, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Absolutely. Okay. So, tell me more. How do I go about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4574118688701794, "w": 0.826293431749087, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "getting this support?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48294872350053314, "w": 0.22383806675666307, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Well, you'd have to have an assessment of your mother's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5083125878248321, "w": 0.8260359915900831, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "needs. That means someone would come round and talk to you about the situation", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5338247349430912, "w": 0.8263162948137854, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and what you need. So, for a start, they'd want to know the amount of time you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5593369197827429, "w": 0.8258158705142642, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "spend looking after your mother every day.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.584849066901002, "w": 0.44600433598534633, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Okay?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6103612517406537, "w": 0.34881288406488475, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Then, they'll probably ask you what sorts of tasks you do for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6358734365803053, "w": 0.8262451424958449, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "your mother. during the day. Things like if she needs help with getting dressed,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.826011898225939, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "for example,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6867864527089166, "w": 0.13832102880100244, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): right? I.e. help her with that. And also, I help her get", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7122986375485681, "w": 0.8259934437342541, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "into the shower in the morning.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7378108223882198, "w": 0.3236163514178125, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yes, that sort of thing. They'll probably ask you if you do the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7633230072278715, "w": 0.8262996857712691, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "shopping for her and help her at meal times and whether she can cope using", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7888351920675231, "w": 0.8268093373166329, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "money.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8143473769071747, "w": 0.08349337478622265, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Yes, that's becoming a bit of a problem. She used to be", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8397111657886887, "w": 0.8263877547065874, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "very good at it, but not anymore.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8652480204190425, "w": 0.338129578828515, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): So recently I've noticed she's started to have quite bad", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.890760205258694, "w": 0.8263545366215547, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "problems with her memory. If I wasn't there, I think she'd forget to eat, for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.8263591502444759, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "example. And often she doesn't seem quite sure what day it is.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9417845749379974, "w": 0.6419829382072876, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}